        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Gaipui ram ning na kabam thui,",
            "Ai puai tat sini gaimei ariu mak;",
            "Ai lung pui ram hei pat lou pui nung tang puni",
            "Ai kap dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "Ai ning mei ram tei mun puang rui padik ge,",
            "Rian ramei tei nai mak nang pan rui;",
            "Guangh tupui ram gaimei ram lapuni.",
            "",
            "2. Ai nruai kum sam thai e thei,",
            "Tingkauh thu tei ai hei Sam tat lana.",
            "Kalvary chingbut banrao thing rukhou tei ,",
            "Ai guang tou bam ni e",
            "",
            "3. Champan zianmei bam cham e thei ,",
            "Chunsi zaeng simei hei kim puni cho,",
            "Chun si zaeng simei guai hei kim kasuan lak ge,",
            "Kap meini tan mak.",
            "",
            "4. Chunsi zaeng si mei khang su lou,",
            "Kau Ravguangc rui suaihiem mei rui gaina;",
            "Buhmaeng kandi thu tei bam cham lou puni e",
            "Kandih kathan thu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
